# The build context is the whole checkout, and a checkout on a real machine
# holds a real book: an .env.local with a service key, a holdings file, a
# folder of broker exports. None of it may land in an image layer.
.env*
!.env.example
**/holdings*.json
**/*.csv
**/.env*.local

.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-demo
**/.vite-temp*
browser/convex
site
ios
tmp
.codex-home
.wrangler
assets/screenshots
assets/demo.gif
